+<tr bgcolor="#ffc8d8"><td rowspan=2><tt>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></td>
+<td colspan=2><tt>The&nbsp;platform&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;target&nbsp;browser&nbsp;is&nbsp;running&nbsp;on.<br>
