+<dl><dt><a name="Platform-StartMonitoringPower"><strong>StartMonitoringPower</strong></a>(self, browser)</dt><dd><tt>Starts&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;power&nbsp;utilization&nbsp;statistics.<br>
+&nbsp;<br>
