+&nbsp;<br>
+Raises:<br>
+&nbsp;&nbsp;ValueError&nbsp;if&nbsp;the&nbsp;required&nbsp;|min_bitrate_mbps|&nbsp;can't&nbsp;be&nbsp;achieved.</tt></dd></dl>
